{"slug": "join-us-at-the-soflo-boat-show-in-miami", "title": "Join Us at the SoFlo Boat Show in Miami for an Unforgettable Weekend!", "description": "Get ready for the marine event of the season at the SoFlo Boat Show, returning to the iconic Miami Marine Stadium from May 17 to May 19...", "date": "2024-05-06", "category": "Blog", "image": "https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/05/Join-Us-at-the-SoFlo-Boat-Show-in-Miami-for-an-Unforgettable-Weekend-1.png", "html": "<p><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/05/Join-Us-at-the-SoFlo-Boat-Show-in-Miami-for-an-Unforgettable-Weekend-1.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Get ready for the marine event of the season at the <a href=\"https://sofloboatshow.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SoFlo Boat Show</a>, returning to the iconic Miami Marine Stadium from May 17 to May 19. This annual showcase promises an exciting lineup of marine vessels, equipment, watersports, and more.</p><p>Experience the thrill of exploring a diverse range of boats, from sleek cruisers to high-performance fishing vessels and beyond. But that’s not all – this year’s show is set to feature a spectacular display from FYI Yachts, including the debut of the stunning<br/> 2024 52′ Okean and 57′ Okean, alongside other remarkable models.</p><p>Don’t miss out on this opportunity to immerse yourself in the boating lifestyle and discover the latest trends in marine technology. Whether you’re in the market for a new boat or simply want to enjoy a day by the water, the SoFlo Boat Show has something for<br/> everyone.</p><p>Join us for a weekend filled with excitement, networking, and entertainment against the backdrop of Miami’s stunning waterfront. Mark your calendars and invite your friends and family – this is an event you won’t want to miss!</p><p><b>Event Details:</b><br/> <b>What:</b> SoFlo Boat Show<br/> <b>Where:</b> Miami Marine Stadium<br/> <b>When:</b> May 17 – May 19<br/> <b>Highlights:</b> FYI Yachts showcase featuring the 2024 52′ Okean and 57′ Okean, Sea Trial Dock, marine equipment exhibits, watersports demos, and more.</p><p>Prepare to set sail into an unforgettable experience at the SoFlo Boat Show. We can’t wait to see you there!</p><p><a href=\"https://sofloboatshow.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Click to learn more about the SoFlo Boat Show!</a></p><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/05/Join-Us-at-the-SoFlo-Boat-Show-in-Miami-for-an-Unforgettable-Weekend-2.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/05/Join-Us-at-the-SoFlo-Boat-Show-in-Miami-for-an-Unforgettable-Weekend-2-150x150.png\" alt=\"Join Us at the SoFlo Boat Show in Miami for an Unforgettable Weekend!\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/05/Join-Us-at-the-SoFlo-Boat-Show-in-Miami-for-an-Unforgettable-Weekend-3.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/05/Join-Us-at-the-SoFlo-Boat-Show-in-Miami-for-an-Unforgettable-Weekend-3-150x150.png\" alt=\"Join Us at the SoFlo Boat Show in Miami for an Unforgettable Weekend!\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/05/Join-Us-at-the-SoFlo-Boat-Show-in-Miami-for-an-Unforgettable-Weekend-4.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/05/Join-Us-at-the-SoFlo-Boat-Show-in-Miami-for-an-Unforgettable-Weekend-4-150x150.png\" alt=\"Join Us at the SoFlo Boat Show in Miami for an Unforgettable Weekend!\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/05/Join-Us-at-the-SoFlo-Boat-Show-in-Miami-for-an-Unforgettable-Weekend-5.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/05/Join-Us-at-the-SoFlo-Boat-Show-in-Miami-for-an-Unforgettable-Weekend-5-150